A while ago, A.Grover posted that he sent the acpi-patch to marcello and then to alan to have it included into -ac-source.
Now, several new versions of the -ac-kernel are out, but the acpi-patch still is not in them. When is this planned?

I think it is very important to have the acpi-patch in the 2.4.20-kernel, as i know several people with computers that don't have any acpi-support without it.

